{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.poster.avif?t=1753862757\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.webm?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/9fab49dc963b7c6b3ae71f5e0a0e9d16.mp4?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Hidden Entrance. A Camera. A Maze Below.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While hiking through dense, overgrown woods, you stumble upon something strange\u2014a damaged and half-buried sewer entrance, hidden beneath moss and leaves. Curiosity gets the better of you. Armed with only a flashlight and a camera, you descend into the unknown, expecting an abandoned tunnel. What you find instead is a vast, shifting labyrinth of sewage, silence\u2026 and something that watches from the dark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, survive, and escape in this tense first-person horror experience\u2014alone or with up to 3 friends online.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once inside, the only way out is to make it through. Navigate the maze of tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and document your descent with your camera. But make too much noise, and you'll attract the attention of a massive, predatory gator that hunts anything that moves. It\u2019s fast. It\u2019s smart. And it knows these tunnels better than you ever will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.poster.avif?t=1753862757\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.webm?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.mp4?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Online Co-op</strong><br>Play solo for a tense, immersive horror experience, or team up with up to four players in cooperative online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Triggered Predator</strong><br>The gator is always listening. Splashing in water, dropping items, even running can give away your location. Stay quiet, move carefully, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Unlock new paths, restore power to locked areas, and work together (or alone) to escape this place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Sewer Layouts</strong><br>With varying maps and randomized elements, every run is different. Learn from your mistakes\u2014but don't expect the same path twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found-Footage Atmosphere</strong><br>Your only companion is your camera. Record your descent, piece together what happened here, and maybe leave behind something for the next unlucky soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the unknown. Stay quiet. Stay alive.</strong><br>Do you dare to find out what lies beneath?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909810?t=1753862757","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909810?t=1753862757","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/