ly way out is to make it through. Navigate the maze of tunnels, solve environmental puzzles, and document your descent with your camera. But make too much noise, and you'll attract the attention of a massive, predatory gator that hunts anything that moves. It\u2019s fast. It\u2019s smart. And it knows these tunnels better than you ever will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.poster.avif?t=1753862757\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.webm?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/extras/2a26803669d4c74b6debf7218244be5e.mp4?t=1753862757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Online Co-op</strong><br>Play solo for a tense, immersive horror experience, or team up with up to four players in cooperative online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Triggered Predator</strong><br>The gator is always listening. Splashing in water, dropping items, even running can give away your location. Stay quiet, move carefully, or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Puzzle Solving</strong><br>Unlock new paths, restore power to locked areas, and work together (or alone) to escape this place.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Sewer Layouts</strong><br>With varying maps and randomized elements, every run is different. Learn from your mistakes\u2014but don't expect the same path twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found-Footage Atmosphere</strong><br>Your only companion is your camera. Record your descent, piece together what happened here, and maybe leave behind something for the next unlucky soul.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the unknown. Stay quiet. Stay alive.</strong><br>Do you dare to find out what lies beneath?</p>","developers":["Mythroot Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909810/75f36fd8af9c4431a29f295bfbb7c4ffeca41a42/header.jpg?t=1753862757","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175615,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175615/movie480.mp4?t=1753862753","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175615/movie_max.mp4?t=1753862753"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175615/0a5e262a41785d3aae4dc546d7bb42f35d1ad3e4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753862753","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175615/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753862753","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175615/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753862753"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257174261,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174261/movie480.mp4?t=1753862756","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174261/movie_max.mp4?t=1753862756"},"name":"Found Footage","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174261/d4d8ec156792d4f9c59ee37c1a8f0fb5fa4a4a5e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753862756","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174261/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753862756","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257174261/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753862756"}}],"name":"Dragged Deep